        "dvt_history": "The patient had a deep vein thrombosis (DVT) of the right leg two years ago; anticoagulation was completed and it has resolved, with no current clot.",
        "acute_pe": "An acute pulmonary embolism was diagnosed two weeks ago on CT, without strain on the right heart; the patient is in the first months of anticoagulant treatment.",
